"Inferno hero" = `HERO_CLASS_INFERNO_MIGHT` (4) / `HERO_CLASS_INFERNO_MAGIC` (12).

| Pieces | Effect | Hook |
|---|---|---|
| 4 | Hero's creatures have `ABILITY_LIQUID_FLAME_BREATH` (168); a melee attack without pattern tiles leaves a flame on the target's tile closest to the attacker | `artfset_inferno_ability` (see "Granting abilities"); `0x00A629DA` (6), see "Liquid Flame Breath" |
| 4 + Inferno class | Fire spells cast by the hero's side are never resisted by enemy units (neutrals included); immunities still apply | `0x0097D2FB` (7) in `func_ComputeSpellDamageMultiplier`, right after the hit chance: when it is not 100 (immune), returns 0 % resisted, skipping the resistance roll, `func_ComputeSpellDamageMitigation` (every spell proof / element resistance multiplier: abilities, buffs, artifacts, skills, `ModSpellProof.cpp`, `ModElementalResistance.cpp`, Sylvan luck proof) and the later penetration hooks (`EarthPierce.cpp`, `ModSpellPenetration.cpp`) |
